{"pageid":4487,"title":"2025 Halloween Event","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2025 Halloween Event</span>","revid":20474,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>2025 Halloween Event</b> (aka <span class=\"new\" title=\"Version 1.93.0 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVmVyc2lvbl8xLjkzLjA/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Version 1.93.0</span>) was released on October 4th, 2025. With this update came many new changes, including <a href=\"/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor\" title=\"The Monstrous Manor\">The Monstrous Manor</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Catseye\" title=\"Catseye\">Catseye</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Spider_Tree\" title=\"Spider Tree\">Spider Tree</a>. It also included the comeback of the <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Moon\" title=\"Blood Moon\">Blood Moon</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<caption>\nCategorized Additions\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Add\n</td>\n<td>Location\n</td>\n<td>Category\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor\" title=\"The Monstrous Manor\">The Monstrous Manor</a>\n</th>\n<th>Taiga\n</th>\n<th>Shop\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Shard\" title=\"Moon Shard\">Moon Shard</a>\n</td>\n<td>Everywhere\n</td>\n<td>Loose Item\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Ghosts\" title=\"Ghosts\">Ghosts</a>\n</td>\n<td>Everywhere\n</td>\n<td>Loose Item\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a> and drops from <a href=\"/wiki/Pumpkinhead\" title=\"Pumpkinhead\">pumpkinhead</a> mobs\n</td>\n<td>Loose Item\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Halloween Rewards\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Daily_Rewards\" title=\"Daily Rewards\">Daily Rewards</a>\n</td>\n<td>UI\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Moon\" title=\"Blood Moon\">Blood Moon</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>\n</td>\n<td>Event\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Hardened_Moon_Rod\" title=\"Hardened Moon Rod\">Hardened Moon Rod</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor\" title=\"The Monstrous Manor\">The Monstrous Manor</a>\n</td>\n<td>Event\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trees\">Trees</span></h3>\n<p>The following trees have been added to the game\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Location\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Hallow_Tree\" title=\"Hallow Tree\">Hallow Tree</a>\n</td>\n<td>Skeleton Meteor crash sites along with Bone trees\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Weeping_Willow\" title=\"Weeping Willow\">Weeping Willow</a>\n</td>\n<td>All over the map\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Spider_Tree\" title=\"Spider Tree\">Spider Tree</a>\n</td>\n<td>All over the map\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Acacia\" title=\"Corrupt Acacia\">Corrupt Acacia</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupted_Cactus\" title=\"Corrupted Cactus\">Corrupted Cactus</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"new\" title=\"Corrupted Palm (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ29ycnVwdGVkX1BhbG0/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Corrupted Palm</span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupted_Wanwood\" title=\"Corrupted Wanwood\">Corrupted Wanwood</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupted_Kelp\" title=\"Corrupted Kelp\">Corrupted Kelp</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Deadwood\" title=\"Corrupt Deadwood\">Corrupt Deadwood</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ores\">Ores</span></h3>\n<p>The following ores and stones have been added to the game\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Location\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Catseye\" title=\"Catseye\">Catseye</a>\n</td>\n<td>Near <a href=\"/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor\" title=\"The Monstrous Manor\">The Monstrous Manor</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"new\" title=\"Corrupted Blackstone (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ29ycnVwdGVkX0JsYWNrc3RvbmU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Corrupted Blackstone</span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupted_limestone\" title=\"Corrupted limestone\">Corrupted limestone</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a>\n</td>\n<td>Drops from mobs, also in Candycorn area in <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sweetstone\" title=\"Sweetstone\">Sweetstone</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902200714\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 39/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0